+<symbol id="people" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3 21v-3a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v3M16 5a3 3 0 0 1 0 6M17 14a5 5 0 0 1 4 5v2"/></symbol>
+<symbol id="note" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-9M8 16l4-1L21 6l-3-3-9 9-1 4Z"/></symbol>
+<symbol id="pin" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12S4 16 4 10a8 8 0 1 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></symbol>
+<symbol id="leaf" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 3C10 2 3 6 5 14s14 7 15-11Z M3 22 15 10"/></symbol>
+<symbol id="check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></symbol>
+<symbol id="shield" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Z M8 12l3 3 5-6"/></symbol>
+<symbol id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></symbol>
+</defs></svg>
+<header><nav class="nav shell" aria-label="主导航"><a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="禾间首页"><span class="brand-mark">禾</span><span class="brand-name">禾间<small>HEJIAN</small></span></a><div class="nav-links"><a href="#restaurant">关于禾间</a><a href="#booking" class="active" aria-current="page">预订席位</a><a href="#visit">到店指南</a></div><div class="nav-note">随时令 · 慢生活</div></nav></header>
+<main class="shell">
+<section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SEAT AT OUR TABLE</p><h1>为相聚，留一席。</h1><p class="intro-copy">一餐一味，一期一会。期待与你共度美好食光。</p></div><div class="intro-aside">Good food. Warm company.<span>把时间留给在意的人</span></div></section>
+<div class="layout"><div><section class="restaurant" id="restaurant" aria-label="餐厅介绍"><div class="restaurant-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1414235077428-338989a2e8c0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="温暖灯光下的精致餐厅，餐桌上摆放着高脚杯与餐具" fetchpriority="high"><span class="image-tag">禾间 · 城市里的自然餐桌</span><div class="image-caption"><div class="overline">SEASONAL & SOULFUL</div><h2>食在当季，心在此间。</h2><p>用一席时令风味，款待每一次相聚。</p></div><span class="image-index">01 / 01</span></div><div class="restaurant-info"><div class="info-top"><h3>禾间 · 自然料理</h3><span class="cuisine">时令食材 · 创意融合</span></div><div class="info-line"><svg><use href="#pin"/></svg><span>杭州 · 西湖区 · 桂隐路 18 号 <small>（示例门店）</small></span></div><div class="info-line"><svg><use href="#clock"/></svg><span>午餐 11:30–14:00<span class="split">/</span>晚餐 17:30–21:00</span></div></div></section><div class="left-note"><svg><use href="#leaf"/></svg>好食材不负时节，好时光不负相遇。</div></div>
+<section class="booking" id="booking"><div class="form-heading"><h2>预订你的席位</h2><span>RESERVATION</span></div><form id="reservation-form">
+<div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="date"><svg><use href="#calendar"/></svg>用餐日期<span class="extra">可预订未来 30 天</span></label><div class="date-row"><input class="date-input" id="date" name="date" type="date" required><button type="button" class="quick-date" id="tomorrow">明天</button><button type="button" class="quick-date" id="weekend">周末</button></div></div>
+<div class="field"><div class="field-label" id="time-label"><svg><use href="#clock"/></svg>用餐时间<span class="extra">请选择到店时间</span></div><div class="periods" role="group" aria-label="用餐时段"><button type="button" class="period" data-period="lunch" aria-pressed="false">午餐 · LUNCH</button><button type="button" class="period selected" data-period="dinner" aria-pressed="true">晚餐 · DINNER</button></div><div class="time-grid" id="time-grid" role="group" aria-labelledby="time-label"></div><p class="time-hint" id="time-hint">从容入席，慢慢享用</p><input type="hidden" id="time" name="time" value="18:00"></div>
+<div class="field"><div class="field-label" id="guest-label"><svg><use href="#people"/></svg>用餐人数</div><div class="guests-row"><div class="counter" role="group" aria-labelledby="guest-label"><button type="button" id="minus" aria-label="减少一位">−</button><output id="guest-display" aria-live="polite">2 位</output><button type="button" id="plus" aria-label="增加一位">+</button></div><span class="guest-note">1–8 位，刚刚好的相聚</span><input type="hidden" name="guests" id="guests" value="2"></div></div>
+<div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="notes"><svg><use href="#note"/></svg>特别备注<span class="extra">选填</span></label><div class="note-wrap"><textarea id="notes" name="notes" maxlength="200" placeholder="食物过敏、特殊纪念日、座位偏好……告诉我们你的期待。"></textarea><span class="char-count"><span id="char-count">0</span> / 200</span></div></div>
+<div class="summary"><span class="summary-label">本次预订</span><output class="summary-content" id="summary" aria-live="polite"></output></div><button type="submit" class="submit">确认订座<svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><p class="form-footnote"><svg><use href="#shield"/></svg>无需预付 · 席位以餐厅最终确认为准</p></form></section></div>
+<section class="details-bar" id="visit" aria-label="订座须知"><div class="detail"><svg><use href="#clock"/></svg><div><h3>为你保留，静候光临</h3><p>席位将为你保留 15 分钟。<br>如有行程变动，请提前与餐厅沟通。</p></div></div><div class="detail"><svg><use href="#leaf"/></svg><div><h3>每一份偏好，都被在意</h3><p>如有食物过敏或特殊饮食需求，<br>欢迎在备注中告知，我们会用心准备。</p></div></div><div class="detail"><svg><use href="#people"/></svg><div><h3>让相聚，多一点心意</h3><p>生日、纪念日或多人聚会，<br>提前留下备注，让我们为你添一份美好。</p></div></div></section>
